// prop_lab: fetched from TradingView 2026-10-08
// url: https://www.tradingview.com/script/muhhiXQs-DayFlow-VWAP-Relay-Forex-Majors-Strategy/
// id: PUB;906cfb45afde4035bd7ac3628450b6ff  kind: strategy  likes: 115
